o}.mw-parser-output .wst-center.wst-center-nomargin>p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"wst-center tiInherit\">\n<div class=\"mw-ext-score-disabled\">Musical scores are temporarily disabled.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"poem\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15431465\">.mw-parser-output .wst-block-center{display:block;margin:0 auto;padding:0;position:relative;max-width:100%;height:auto;text-align:initial}.mw-parser-output .wst-block-center-title{display:inline-block;width:100%;text-align:center}</style><div class=\"wst-block-center\" style=\"width:fit-content;\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15551948\">.mw-parser-output .wst_list_continuation>li:first-child{list-style-type:none;list-style-image:none}.mw-parser-output .wst_ulist.__idx_hi1,.mw-parser-output .wst_ulist.__plain{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;list-style-image:none;margin-left:0}.mw-parser-output .wst_ulist.__nomarker{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;list-style-image:none}.mw-parser-output .__fixleft{margin-left:1.6em}.mw-parser-output .wst_olist.__idx_hi1 ol,.mw-parser-output .wst_olist.__plain ol,.mw-parser-output .wst_ulist.__idx_hi1 ul,.mw-parser-output .wst_ulist.__plain ul{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0}.mw-parser-output .wst_olist.__plain li,.mw-parser-output .wst_ulist.__plain li{margin-bottom:0}.mw-parser-output .wst_olist.__idx_hi1 li,.mw-parser-output .wst_ulist.__idx_hi1 li{margin-left:1em;text-indent:-1em;margin-bottom:0}.mw-parser-output .wst_list_continuation.__idx_hi1>li:first-child{list-style-type:none;list-style-image:none;margin-left:1em;text-indent:0}.mw-parser-output .wst_olist.__inside,.mw-parser-output .wst_ulist.__inside{list-style-position:inside;margin-left:0}</style><ol class=\"wst&#95;olist\"><li>Hark! The herald angels sing, <br />\n'Glory to the new-born King;<br />\nPeace on Earth, and mercy mild, <br />\nGod and sinners reconciled!'<br />\nJoyful, all ye nations rise, <br />\nJoin the triumph of the skies;<br />\nWith th'angelic host proclaim <br />\n'Christ is born in Bethlehem!'<br />\nHark! the herald angels sing,<br />\n'Glory to the new born king!'<br /></li><li>Christ, by highest heaven adored, <br />\nChrist, the everlasting Lord!<br />\nCome, Desire of Nations, come, <br />\nFix in us thy humble home.<br />\nVeiled in flesh the Godhead see; <br />\nHail th'Incarnate Deity,<br />\nPleased as man with men to dwell; <br />\nJesus, Our Emmanuel!<br />\nHark! the herald angels sing,<br />\n'Glory to the new born king!'<br /></li><li>Hail, the heav'n born Prince of Peace! <br />\nHail the sun of Righteousness!<br />\nLight and life to all he brings, <br />\nRisen with healing in his wings;<br />\nMild he lays his glory by, <br />\nBorn that no more may die,<br />\nBorn to raise the sons of earth, <br />\nBorn to give them second birth;<br />\nHark! the herald angels sing, <br />\n'Glory to the new born king!'<br />\n<span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">A-men</span></li></ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&#32;\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐5f8dd6899c‐rqt4t\nCached time: 20261025031327\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Header (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update, vary‐page‐id, vary‐revision‐sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.170 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.320 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 373/1000000\nRevision size: 575/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 12668/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5866/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/100\nExpensive parser function count: 5/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 2/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9225/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.089/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1511819/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 4/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  309.014      1 -total\n 52.90%  163.475      1 Template:Header\n 25.19%   77.843      1 Template